<!-- This list field orders the CORE members only (always present, so no absence hazard); sub-plugin members pin themselves via list-before/list-after against these anchors — an absent sub-plugin is an inert pin, and the natural fallback equals the old degraded order. -->
list: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/group-by/project $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/group-by/realm $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/group-by/status
title: $:/tags/hypergsd/GroupBy

<!-- Tag list for $hgsd.list's grouping strip. Members carry pure data plus a caption (a lingo transclusion — the core PageControls convention) that names the dimension for BOTH this Settings drag list and the strip; `hgsd-group-key` remains only as the lingo-fallback id for caption-less third-party members; `hgsd-group-filter` is a per-item filter emitting the item's group key(s) as tiddler titles, evaluated with currentTiddler = the item — tags-based members emit multiple keys and items rightly render under every group; optional `hgsd-label-filter` computes heading display text, evaluated with currentTiddler = the group title (default: the title). Ordering: the list field above (core members), member pins, then alphabetical. Keys are normally tiddler titles and headings link them even when missing (realm/project links navigate-create); a member whose keys are synthetic (e.g. the status member's rank-prefixed words, which carry status-set order through sort[title]) declares `hgsd-synthetic-keys` and renders plain headings. -->